{"author_count":1,"contributors":["Bahr, Patrick"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-383320"],"filters":{"added":"2024-06","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"1 contributor","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-ITU","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-ITU","DI-U-KU"]},"review":"nr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"compositional data types a report from the field","src":["itu"],"src-code":["DI-U-ITU"],"type":"dba","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"http://www.diku.dk/forskning/Publikationer/tekniske_rapporter/2011/","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-383320","ids":["itu-8c0b56b3-3f10-4138-aae5-b3d287ce8c30"],"lang":"Undetermined","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Local-1-1-EE1FB3DF9C6274F33013040F3C498DE3"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"http://www.diku.dk/forskning/Publikationer/tekniske_rapporter/2011/","version":"Other Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"itu it university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-ITU","l3nl":"IT University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"ITU IT University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"ITU IT University of Copenhagen","namevar":["IT University of Copenhagen, Computer Science"],"nora_code":"DI-U-ITU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"dk","key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-KU","l3nl":"University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"KU University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KU University of Copenhagen","namevar":["University of Copenhagen"],"nora_code":"DI-U-KU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1 2","corresponding":null,"first":"Patrick","key":"bahrpau","last":"Bahr","locid":"5e271e6a-7a91-47bd-9f12-3b73f4e0d7ac","name":"Bahr, Patrick","orcid":"0000-0003-1600-8261","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"status":"p","title":"Proceedings of the 4th DIKU-IST Joint Workshop on Foundations of Software"},"review":"No Review","search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","IT University of Copenhagen","Universities","University of Copenhagen"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["itu-8c0b56b3-3f10-4138-aae5-b3d287ce8c30"],"src":["ITU IT University of Copenhagen"],"title":"Compositional Data Types - A Report from the Field","type":"Book Chapter","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-383320","year":"2011","yearsub":"2011"}
{"abstract":"Building on Wouter Swierstra's Data types à la carte, we present a comprehensive Haskell library of compositional data types suitable for practical applications. In this framework, data types and functions on them can be defined in a modular fashion. We extend the existing work by implementing a wide array of recursion schemes including monadic computations. Above all, we generalise recursive data types to contexts, which allow us to characterise a special yet frequent kind of catamorphisms. The thus established notion of term homomorphisms allows for flexible reuse and enables short-cut fusion style deforestation which yields considerable speedups. We demonstrate our framework in the setting of compiler construction, and moreover, we compare compositional data types with generic programming techniques and show that both are comparable in run-time performance and expressivity while our approach allows for stricter types. We substantiate this conclusion by lifting compositional data types to mutually recursive data types and generalised algebraic data types. Lastly, we compare the run-time performance of our techniques with traditional implementations over algebraic data types. The results are surprisingly good.","author_count":2,"contributors":["Bahr, Patrick","Hvitved, Tom"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-384709"],"filters":{"added":"2024-06","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["algebraic programming deforestation mutual recursion reusability"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-ITU","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-ITU","DI-U-KU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"compositional data types","src":["itu"],"src-code":["DI-U-ITU"],"type":"dba","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"http://doi.acm.org/10.1145/2036918.2036930","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-384709","identifier":[{"id":"80155129968","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["itu-e99510c3-ea3d-4f88-be54-e221ccc5c671"],"keyword":["algebraic programming, deforestation, mutual recursion, reusability"],"lang":"Undetermined","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-3-5-70F304D744F86B8DD56D4250FE658A8F"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"http://doi.acm.org/10.1145/2036918.2036930","version":"Other Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"itu it university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-ITU","l3nl":"IT University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"ITU IT University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"ITU IT University of Copenhagen","namevar":["IT University of Copenhagen, Computer Science"],"nora_code":"DI-U-ITU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"dk","key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-KU","l3nl":"University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"KU University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KU University of Copenhagen","namevar":["University of Copenhagen"],"nora_code":"DI-U-KU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1 2","corresponding":null,"first":"Patrick","key":"bahrpau","last":"Bahr","locid":"5e271e6a-7a91-47bd-9f12-3b73f4e0d7ac","name":"Bahr, Patrick","orcid":"0000-0003-1600-8261","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Tom","key":"hvitvedpau","last":"Hvitved","name":"Hvitved, Tom","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.1145/2036918.2036930","isbn":["9781450308618"],"pages":"83-94","place":"New York, NY, USA","publisher":"Association for Computing Machinery","status":"p","title":"Proceedings of the seventh ACM SIGPLAN workshop on Generic programming"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-80155129968"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","IT University of Copenhagen","Universities","University of Copenhagen"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["itu-e99510c3-ea3d-4f88-be54-e221ccc5c671"],"src":["ITU IT University of Copenhagen"],"title":"Compositional data types","type":"Book Chapter","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-384709","year":"2011","yearsub":"2011"}
{"abstract":"We describe how to perform monadic computations over recursive datastructures with fine grained control over the evaluationstrategy. This solves the issue that the definition of a recursivemonadic function already determines the evaluation strategy due tothe necessary sequencing of the monadic operations. We show thatcompositional data types already provide the structure needed inorder to delay monadic computations at any point of the computation.","author_count":3,"contributors":["Bahr, Patrick"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-400675"],"event":{"end":"2011-10-28","place":"Västerås, se","start":"2011-10-26","title":"23rd Nordic Workshop on Programming Theory","year":"2011"},"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Faculty of Science","Generic programming","Haskell","Monads"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-KU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"evaluation à la carte non strict evaluation via compositional data types","src":["ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-KU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://curis.ku.dk/ws/files/35249190/bahr11nwpt2_extended_abstract.pdf","version":"Authors Final Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-400675","ids":["ku-0c16a40e-c8c3-4398-b054-2a7e7eb41757"],"keyword":["Faculty of Science","Haskell","evaluation strategies","generic programming","monads","tree transformations"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Local-1-1-88ABD3FBC509B63227399F6D072B0EE1"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://curis.ku.dk/ws/files/35249190/bahr11nwpt2_extended_abstract.pdf","version":"Authors Final Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-KU","l3nl":"University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"KU University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KU University of Copenhagen","namevar":["Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Science, Department of Computer Science"],"nora_code":"DI-U-KU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","country":"dk","first":"Patrick","key":"bahrpau","last":"Bahr","locid":"0df28789-7837-4997-9abf-945875a7c0c9","name":"Bahr, Patrick","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Paul","key":"petterssonpedh","last":"Pettersson","name":"Pettersson, Paul","rank":2,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"Cristina","key":"seceleanupedh","last":"Seceleanu","name":"Seceleanu, Cristina","rank":3,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"}],"pub":{"issn":["14043041"],"pages":"38-40","publisher":"Mälardalen University","series":"Technical Report","status":"p","title":"Proceedings of the 23rd Nordic Workshop on Programming Theory"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities","University of Copenhagen"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["ku-0c16a40e-c8c3-4398-b054-2a7e7eb41757"],"src":["KU University of Copenhagen"],"title":"Evaluation à la carte : non-strict evaluation via compositional data types","type":"Conference Paper","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-400675","year":"2011","yearsub":"2011"}
{"abstract":"We describe our work on developing a functional domain specific language for specifying business reports. The report specification language is part of a novel enterprise resource planing system based on the idea of a providing a lean core system that is highly customisable via a variety of domain specific languages.","author_count":3,"contributors":["Bahr, Patrick"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-382019"],"filters":{"added":"2024-06","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["domain specific language nominal subtyping incrementalisation enterprise resource planning query database transaction system"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-ITU","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-ITU","DI-U-KU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"a functional language for specifying business reports","src":["itu"],"src-code":["DI-U-ITU"],"type":"dba","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"http://www.mrtc.mdh.se/nwpt2011/index.php?choice=program","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-382019","ids":["itu-336ac564-971e-4bde-b58a-aa0a5e7f2a32"],"keyword":["domain specific language,nominal subtyping,incrementalisation,enterprise resource planning,query,database, transaction system"],"lang":"Undetermined","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Local-1-1-B6DC9A811D29D97D7A836F99C43E087D"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"http://www.mrtc.mdh.se/nwpt2011/index.php?choice=program","version":"Other Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"itu it university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-ITU","l3nl":"IT University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"ITU IT University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"ITU IT University of Copenhagen","namevar":["IT University of Copenhagen, Computer Science"],"nora_code":"DI-U-ITU","used":1},{"aff