{"abstract":"We describe our work on developing a functional domain specificlanguage for specifying business reports. The report specificationlanguage is part of a novel enterprise resource planing system basedon the idea of a providing a lean core system that is highlycustomisable via a variety of domain specific languages.","author_count":3,"contributors":["Bahr, Patrick"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-436096"],"event":{"end":"2011-10-28","place":"Västerås, se","start":"2011-10-26","title":"23rd Nordic Workshop on Programming Theory","year":"2011"},"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Database","Domain specific language","Enterprise Resource Planning","Faculty of Social Sciences","Query"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-KU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"a functional language for specifying business reports","src":["ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-KU"],"type":"dca","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://curis.ku.dk/ws/files/35249115/bahr11nwpt_extended_abstract.pdf","version":"Authors Final Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-436096","ids":["ku-477963d6-3f0d-47cf-9000-512a7d94f1d1"],"keyword":["Faculty of Social Sciences","database","domain specific language","enterprise resource planning","incrementalisation","nominal subtyping","query","transaction system"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Local-1-1-AA0E407231DB4286C379FFDEEAB18805"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://curis.ku.dk/ws/files/35249115/bahr11nwpt_extended_abstract.pdf","version":"Authors Final Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-KU","l3nl":"University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"KU University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU"